                                "sense_id": "9a2c2e88-d303-38f3-8a99-ce26f7f28b04",
                                "text": "Palin acts like schools are tossing IUDs into playgrounds and kids are just running around, grabbing Mirenas without telling their parents. What she isn't doing is: A) Asking if a girl might obtain birth control for a reason other than birth control, B) Considering that just because parental consent is not required that it is never asked for or given."
