                                "sense_id": "9a2c2e88-d303-38f3-8a99-ce26f7f28b04",
                                "text": "\"I went back to surgery to get two mirena [an hormonal intrauterine device] inserted to treat my adeno,\" she said. \"What followed was three months of pain and illness and discomfort. I think I vomited every day, pretty much."
